data: {"id": "ed77f29e5b644ac2-thinking-parallel_evidence-2399", "run_id": "ed77f29e5b644ac2", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "已采集到多维度事实，支持对 CrashLoopBackOff 直接原因的定位：\n\n## 实体确认\n- **Pod**: `workload-7679bcf76-n5vp8`, namespace `aiops-case-06`, UID `08e11260-3505-495c-8224-2b91f27f029c`\n- **Owner**: ReplicaSet `workload-7679bcf76`\n- **容器**: `app` (image: `xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`, command: `python3 /opt/aiops/server.py`)\n- **节点**: `node2`\n\n## 支持证据\n1. **Kubernetes 生命周期状态**: Pod 处于 Running phase，但 condition `ContainersReady=False`，containerStatus `reason=CrashLoopBackOff`, `exitCode=2`, `restarts=", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 5, "ts_ms": 1789068305440, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

