论\n\n已确认根因为：**应用进程在 `/work` 路径处理请求时发生未捕获的内部逻辑错误，导致进程主动异常退出（exitCode 2）。**\n\n证据表明，虽然集群资源（CPU/Memory limits）充足且配置无异常，但应用代码在处理特定请求时产生了致命错误（`HTTP 500`，见 fact-6）。进程随后退出（`exit_code: 2`，见 fact-4），Kubernetes 试图重启容器（fact-1），但因程序逻辑未修复，进程再次崩溃，最终陷入 `CrashLoopBackOff` 状态（fact-2）。日志与追踪通过唯一的 `trace_id` (fact-8) 相互印证，完整复现了“请求处理-发生错误-进程退出”的闭环。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.9m\n├─ 问题定位: 26.0s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 73.7s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-n5vp8: 73.7s (Evidence 63.9s, RCA 9.6s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 13.7s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-n5vp8**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 113.421, "metrics": {"run_id": "ed77f29e5b644ac2", "mttr": {"value": "1.9m", "seconds": 113.42293691635132, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "51%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-crashloop-runtime"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.95, "weighted_score"